      "side": 1,
      "message": "The #if check is necessary here to prevent link errors. The function use_flash_addresses() is provided by a private library that is currently only available for ELANI80SA; it is not defined in the library for ELAN80SG.\nIf we use only a runtime if check, the linker will still attempt to resolve the symbol, resulting in the following error during the linking stage: ld.lld: error: undefined symbol: use_flash_addresses",
